{"slug":"claude-feishu-channel","title":"Claude Feishu Channel","date":"2026-04-13","tags":["Claude","Feishu","AI","TypeScript"],"category":"project","excerpt":"将 Claude Code 会话桥接到飞书群聊机器人","author":"Dongsheng Zhao","readingTime":1,"contentHtml":"<blockquote>\n<p>将 Claude Code 会话桥接到飞书群聊机器人，在飞书中发送消息，Claude 使用完整的工具能力处理后，以交互式卡片的形式将结果流式回传</p>\n</blockquote>\n<h2 id=\"介绍\">介绍</h2>\n<p>Claude Feishu Channel 是一个将 Claude Code 会话桥接到飞书（Lark）群聊的工具。通过它，你可以直接在飞书群中与 Claude Code 交互，享受完整的 Agent 能力——文件编辑、Shell 命令执行、代码搜索、规划等，所有操作结果都会以交互式卡片的形式实时展示在群聊中</p>\n<h2 id=\"特性\">特性</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>完整的 Claude Code Agent 能力</strong> - 支持文件编辑、Shell 命令、搜索、规划等全部工具</li>\n<li><strong>权限审批机制</strong> - 通过飞书交互式卡片进行权限审批，安全可控</li>\n<li><strong>会话持久化</strong> - 支持进程重启后自动恢复会话</li>\n<li><strong>消息队列与中断</strong> - 使用 <code>!</code> 前缀可中断当前任务并执行新指令</li>\n<li><strong>流式交互卡片</strong> - 实时展示处理状态、工具调用、思考过程</li>\n<li><strong>运行时配置</strong> - 通过 <code>/config set</code> 命令无需重启即可修改配置</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"安装使用\">安装&#x26;使用</h2>\n<div class=\"svp-code-block-wrapper\"><div class=\"svp-code-block\">\n    \n    <pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes vitesse-light night-owl\" style=\"background-color:#ffffff;--shiki-dark-bg:#011627;color:#393a34;--shiki-dark:#d6deeb\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#59873A;--shiki-light-font-style:inherit;--shiki-dark:#82AAFF;--shiki-dark-font-style:italic\">npm</span><span style=\"color:#B56959;--shiki-dark:#ECC48D\"> install</span><span style=\"color:#A65E2B;--shiki-dark:#82AAFF\"> -g</span><span style=\"color:#B56959;--shiki-dark:#ECC48D\"> claude-feishu-channel</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#59873A;--shiki-light-font-style:inherit;--shiki-dark:#82AAFF;--shiki-dark-font-style:italic\">cfc</span><span style=\"color:#B56959;--shiki-dark:#ECC48D\"> init</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#59873A;--shiki-light-font-style:inherit;--shiki-dark:#82AAFF;--shiki-dark-font-style:italic\">vim</span><span style=\"color:#B56959;--shiki-dark:#ECC48D\"> ~/.claude-feishu-channel/config.toml</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#59873A;--shiki-light-font-style:inherit;--shiki-dark:#82AAFF;--shiki-dark-font-style:italic\">cfc</span></span></code></pre>\n    <div class=\"svp-code-block--lang\">bash</div>\n    <button class=\"svp-code-block--copy-btn\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><span class=\"svp-code-block--copy-icon\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"></path></svg></span><span class=\"svp-code-block--check-icon\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><polyline points=\"20 6 9 17 4 12\"></polyline></svg></span></button>\n    \n  </div>\n</div>\n<h2 id=\"常用命令\">常用命令</h2>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>命令</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><code>/new</code></td>\n<td>开始新会话</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>/stop</code></td>\n<td>中断当前生成</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>/status</code></td>\n<td>查看会话状态</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>/resume &#x3C;id></code></td>\n<td>恢复之前的会话</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>/cd &#x3C;path></code></td>\n<td>切换工作目录</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>/config set &#x3C;key> &#x3C;value></code></td>\n<td>运行时修改配置</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>!&#x3C;text></code></td>\n<td>中断并执行新指令</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<h2 id=\"仓库\">仓库</h2>\n<p><a href=\"https://github.com/Blackman99/claude-feishu-channel\">Claude Feishu Channel - GitHub</a></p>","related":[{"slug":"vscode-freemarker","title":"Freemarker Plus","date":"2025-05-26","tags":["Java","Freemarker","Template language","VSCode"],"category":"project","excerpt":"在 VSCode 中 提供 freemarker 语言支持","author":"Dongsheng Zhao","readingTime":1},{"slug":"negozio","title":"Atomique","date":"2023-12-05","tags":["React"],"category":"project","excerpt":"一个可用于 React18+ 的原子化状态管理模型，芥子纳须弥","author":"Dongsheng Zhao","readingTime":1},{"slug":"joueur","title":"Joueur","date":"2023-10-31","cover":"/logos/joueur.png","tags":["Svelte","Tauri","Music Player","Linux"],"category":"project","excerpt":"Joueur - 一个小巧精美的跨平台音乐播放器","author":"Dongsheng Zhao","readingTime":1}]}